1790
01:27:04,010 --> 01:27:06,846
<i>♪ …cada instante. ♪</i>

1791
01:27:09,098 --> 01:27:10,683
Buenas, damita.

1792
01:27:10,767 --> 01:27:12,060
Hola.

1793
01:27:13,186 --> 01:27:14,562
